<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Evolución de Variables · Puntal Agro</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/Chart.js/4.4.1/chart.umd.js"></script>
<style>
:root{--bg:#F0F2F5;--card:#fff;--border:#E4E8EE;--text:#0F1923;--muted:#7A8899;--radius:12px;--mono:'DM Mono',monospace;--sans:'DM Sans',sans-serif;}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{font-family:var(--sans);background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-size:15px;min-height:100vh}
header{background:var(--card);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:10px 24px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.logo-icon{width:30px;height:30px;background:#0F1923;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.logo-icon svg{width:16px;height:16px;fill:none;stroke:#fff;stroke-width:1.5}
.logo-title{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.2px}
.logo-sub{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}
.inst-bar{background:#E8EDF2;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:8px 24px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.inst-lbl{font-size:10px;color:#475569;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap}
.inst-btn{padding:5px 14px;border-radius:20px;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer;border:1.5px solid #CBD5E1;background:var(--card);color:#475569;transition:all .12s;font-family:var(--sans)}
.inst-btn.active{background:#0F1923;color:#fff;border-color:#0F1923}
.inst-desc{font-size:11px;color:#64748B;margin-left:4px}
.inst-right{margin-left:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.upd{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);background:var(--bg);padding:3px 8px;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid var(--border);font-family:var(--mono);white-space:nowrap}
.fbar{background:var(--card);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:8px 24px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.fl{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;font-weight:500}
.pills{display:flex;gap:5px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.pill{padding:4px 10px;border-radius:20px;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer;border:1.5px solid var(--border);background:var(--bg);color:var(--muted);transition:all .12s;font-family:var(--sans);white-space:nowrap}
.p-macro{background:#FFFBEB;color:#92400E;border-color:#FCD34D}
.p-granos{background:#F0FDF4;color:#166534;border-color:#86EFAC}
.p-hac{background:#FEF2F2;color:#991B1B;border-color:#FCA5A5}
.p-leche{background:#F0F9FF;color:#075985;border-color:#7DD3FC}
.sep{width:1px;height:18px;background:var(--border)}
.per-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.per-btn{padding:4px 10px;border-radius:6px;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer;border:1.5px solid var(--border);background:var(--bg);color:var(--muted);font-family:var(--sans)}
.per-btn.on{background:#0F1923;color:#fff;border-color:#0F1923}
.per-custom{display:none;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:var(--card);padding:4px 8px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--border)}
.per-custom.show{display:flex}
.per-custom select{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:12px;color:var(--text);background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:5px;padding:2px 5px;cursor:pointer}
.per-custom button{padding:3px 10px;border-radius:6px;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer;border:1.5px solid #0F1923;background:#0F1923;color:#fff;font-family:var(--sans)}

main{padding:18px 24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px}

.block{padding:14px 16px;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid var(--border)}
.block-macro  {background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,251,235,0.5) 0%,#fff 80%)}
.block-granos {background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(240,253,244,0.5) 0%,#fff 80%)}
.block-hac    {background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(254,242,242,0.5) 0%,#fff 80%)}
.block-leche  {background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(240,249,255,0.5) 0%,#fff 80%)}
.block-title{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.6px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;cursor:pointer;user-select:none}
.block-title-toggle{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);width:18px;height:18px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:4px;transition:all .15s}
.block-title:hover .block-title-toggle{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text)}
.block-title-name{color:var(--text);font-weight:700}
.block-title-count{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);font-family:var(--mono);background:var(--card);padding:1px 8px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--border)}
.block-title-line{flex:1;height:1px;background:var(--border);margin-left:4px}
.block-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(265px,1fr));gap:10px;transition:opacity .2s}
.block-grid.collapsed{display:none}
.block.collapsed{padding-bottom:8px}
.block.collapsed .block-title{margin-bottom:0}

.vc{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:0;transition:all .18s ease;cursor:pointer;position:relative;overflow:hidden;min-height:138px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.vc:hover{box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(15,25,35,0.08);transform:translateY(-1px)}
.vc.off{opacity:.4}
.vc.off:hover{opacity:.7;transform:none}
.vc-top{padding:11px 14px 6px 14px;border-left:3px solid transparent;flex:1}
.vc-s-ipc .vc-top{border-left-color:#9A3412}
.vc-s-tco .vc-top{border-left-color:#185FA5}
.vc-s-tcm .vc-top{border-left-color:#075985}
.vc-s-tcb .vc-top{border-left-color:#0E7490}
.vc-s-trg .vc-top{border-left-color:#3B6D11}
.vc-s-mai .vc-top{border-left-color:#854F0B}
.vc-s-sor .vc-top{border-left-color:#9A3412}
.vc-s-soj .vc-top{border-left-color:#185FA5}
.vc-s-gir .vc-top{border-left-color:#6B21A8}
.vc-s-h1  .vc-top{border-left-color:#7C2D12}
.vc-s-h2  .vc-top{border-left-color:#9F1239}
.vc-s-h3  .vc-top{border-left-color:#BE185D}
.vc-s-h4  .vc-top{border-left-color:#A21CAF}
.vc-s-h5  .vc-top{border-left-color:#7E22CE}
.vc-s-h6  .vc-top{border-left-color:#6B21A8}
.vc-s-lec .vc-top{border-left-color:#075985}
.vc-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:6px;margin-bottom:4px}
.vc-name{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);letter-spacing:.1px;line-height:1.2}
.vc-fuente{font-size:9px;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.4px;font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap;padding-top:2px}
.vc-valrow{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:6px;margin-top:4px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.vc-val{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:22px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);line-height:1.05;white-space:nowrap}
.vc-unit{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:500}
.vc-deltarow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.vc-delta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;font-size:11px;font-family:var(--mono);font-weight:600}
.vc-delta-arrow{font-size:13px;line-height:1;font-weight:700}
.vc-delta-up{color:#166534}
.vc-delta-down{color:#991B1B}
.vc-delta-neutral{color:var(--muted)}
.vc-delta-lbl{font-size:9px;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.4px;font-weight:500;font-family:var(--sans);margin-left:1px}
.vc-fecha{font-size:9px;color:var(--muted);font-family:var(--mono);margin-left:auto;white-space:nowrap}
.vc-spark-area{height:50px;position:relative;padding:2px 6px 6px 6px;background:#FAFBFC;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
.vc-spark-area canvas{width:100%!important;height:100%!important}
.vc-empty{background:#FAFBFC;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;text-align:center;padding:30px 8px;border-color:#E4E8EE;font-style:italic;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;min-height:138px;border:1px dashed var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius)}
.vc-empty-name{font-style:normal;font-weight:600;color:#475569;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px}

.varpanel{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:14px 18px}
.varpanel-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:12px}
.varpanel-title{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;color:var(--muted)}
.varpanel-sub{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);font-family:var(--mono)}
.varbar-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:155px 1fr 80px;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:3px 0;font-size:11px}
.varbar-name{color:var(--text);font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;padding-right:4px}
.varbar-dot{display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:2px;margin-right:5px;vertical-align:middle}
.varbar-track{position:relative;height:14px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden}
.varbar-track::after{content:'';position:absolute;left:50%;top:0;bottom:0;width:1px;background:#CBD5E1}
.varbar-fill{position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;border-radius:2px;transition:width .3s}
.varbar-fill-pos{background:#22C55E;left:50%}
.varbar-fill-neg{background:#EF4444;right:50%}
.varbar-val{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;font-weight:600;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap}
.varbar-val-pos{color:#166534}
.varbar-val-neg{color:#991B1B}
.varbar-val-neutral{color:var(--muted)}

.card{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:16px}
.chd{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
.ct{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;color:var(--muted)}
.ct-sub{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);font-family:var(--mono);margin-left:6px}
.legrow{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:8px}
.leg{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:11px;color:var(--text);padding:2px 5px;border-radius:4px}
.leg-line{width:14px;height:2px;display:inline-block;flex-shrink:0;border-radius:1px}
.cw{position:relative;width:100%;height:380px}
.pnote{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px;padding:8px 12px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:6px;line-height:1.5}

footer{padding:10px 24px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--card);font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}

@media (max-width:768px){
  .block-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .cw{height:300px}
  main{padding:12px 14px;gap:14px}
  .inst-bar,.fbar{padding:8px 14px}
  .varbar-row{grid-template-columns:110px 1fr 65px;gap:6px}
}
@media (max-width:480px){
  .block-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .varbar-row{grid-template-columns:95px 1fr 60px;font-size:10px}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="logo">
    <div class="logo-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg></div>
    <div>
      <div class="logo-title">Evolución de Variables · Contexto económico, granos, hacienda y leche</div>
      <div class="logo-sub">Puntal Agro</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="inst-bar">
  <span class="inst-lbl">Vista:</span>
  <button class="inst-btn active" id="vistaNom" onclick="setVista('nom',this)">Nominal</button>
  <button class="inst-btn" id="vistaReal" onclick="setVista('real',this)">Real</button>
  <button class="inst-btn" id="vistaUsd" onclick="setVista('usd',this)">USD</button>
  <span class="inst-desc" id="vistaDesc">Valores en su unidad natural</span>
  <div class="inst-right">
    <div class="upd" id="updBadge">—</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="fbar">
  <span class="fl">Período</span>
  <div class="per-row">
    <button class="per-btn" onclick="setPer(3,this)">3m</button>
    <button class="per-btn" onclick="setPer(6,this)">6m</button>
    <button class="per-btn" onclick="setPer('ytd',this)">YTD</button>
    <button class="per-btn on" onclick="setPer(12,this)">12m</button>
    <button class="per-btn" onclick="setPer(24,this)">24m</button>
    <button class="per-btn" onclick="setPer(60,this)">5a</button>
    <button class="per-btn" onclick="setPer('all',this)">Todo</button>
    <button class="per-btn" onclick="toggleCustom(this)">Personalizado ▾</button>
  </div>
  <div class="per-custom" id="perCustom">
    <span class="fl">Desde</span>
    <select id="cFrom"></select>
    <span class="fl">Hasta</span>
    <select id="cTo"></select>
    <button onclick="applyCustom()">Aplicar</button>
  </div>
  <div class="sep"></div>
  <span class="fl">Puntal Agro</span>
</div>

<div class="fbar" style="background:var(--bg);padding-top:10px;padding-bottom:10px">
  <span class="fl">Variables activas</span>
  <div class="pills" id="pillsRow"></div>
</div>

<main>
  <div class="block block-macro" id="block-macro">
    <div class="block-title" onclick="togBlock('macro')"><span class="block-title-toggle" id="tg-macro">▾</span><span class="block-title-name">Macro</span><span class="block-title-count" id="cnt-macro">—</span><span class="block-title-line"></span></div>
    <div class="block-grid" id="grpMacro"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="block block-granos" id="block-granos">
    <div class="block-title" onclick="togBlock('granos')"><span class="block-title-toggle" id="tg-granos">▾</span><span class="block-title-name">Granos disponibles Rosario</span><span class="block-title-count" id="cnt-granos">—</span><span class="block-title-line"></span></div>
    <div class="block-grid" id="grpGranos"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="block block-hac" id="block-hac">
    <div class="block-title" onclick="togBlock('hac')"><span class="block-title-toggle" id="tg-hac">▾</span><span class="block-title-name">Hacienda</span><span class="block-title-count" id="cnt-hac">—</span><span class="block-title-line"></span></div>
    <div class="block-grid" id="grpHacienda"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="block block-leche" id="block-leche">
    <div class="block-title" onclick="togBlock('leche')"><span class="block-title-toggle" id="tg-leche">▾</span><span class="block-title-name">Leche</span><span class="block-title-count" id="cnt-leche">—</span><span class="block-title-line"></span></div>
    <div class="block-grid" id="grpLeche"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="varpanel">
    <div class="varpanel-head">
      <span class="varpanel-title">Variación último mes · todas las variables</span>
      <span class="varpanel-sub" id="varpanelSub">—</span>
    </div>
    <div id="varBars"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="chd">
      <div>
        <span class="ct">Gráfico comparativo · índice base 100</span>
        <span class="ct-sub" id="baseInfo"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="legrow" id="legRow"></div>
    <div class="cw"><canvas id="bigChart"></canvas></div>
    <div class="pnote">Cada serie se normaliza a base 100 en el primer mes con dato del período. Esto permite comparar variables de escalas muy distintas (% de inflación, $/USD, U$S/ton, $/kg). Tocá las tarjetas o pills para sumar/quitar series del gráfico.</div>
  </div>
</main>

<footer>
  <span>Evolución de Variables · Puntal Agro</span>
  <span id="fts">—</span>
</footer>
